Manage your DataViz deployment.

USAGE:
  scw dataviz deployment <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  create      Create a new DataViz deployment
  delete      Delete a DataViz deployment
  get         Retrieve a specific DataViz deployment
  list        Retrieve a list of DataViz deployments
  update      Update a DataViz deployment
  upgrade     Upgrade a DataViz deployment

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for deployment
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw dataviz deployment [command] --help" for more information about a command.
